      "content": "#include <iostream>\n#include <vector>\n#include <cstdio>\n#include <climits>\n#include <cassert>\n\nstruct FastScanner {\n    static const int BUFSIZE = 1 << 20;\n    char buf[BUFSIZE];\n    int idx, size;\n    FastScanner() : idx(0), size(0) {}\n    inline char getChar() {\n        if (idx >= size) {\n            size = fread(buf, 1, BUFSIZE, stdin);\n            idx = 0;\n            if (size == 0) return 0;\n        }\n        return buf[idx++];\n    }\n    int nextInt() {\n        char c;\n        do { c = getChar(); } while (c <= ' ');\n        int sign = 1;\n        if (c == '-') { sign = -1; c = getChar(); }\n        int x = 0;\n        while (c >= '0' && c <= '9') {\n            x = x * 10 + (c - '0');\n            c = getChar();\n        }\n        return sign * x;\n    }\n};\n\nint main() {\n    FastScanner fs;\n    int n = fs.nextInt();\n    int s = fs.nextInt();\n\n    std::vector<int> pref((size_t)(n + 1) * n, 0);\n    for (int i = 1; i <= n; ++i) {\n        const int base = i * n;\n        const int prev = (i - 1) * n;\n        for (int j = 0; j < n; ++j) {\n            pref[base + j] = pref[prev + j] + fs.nextInt();\n        }\n    }\n\n    assert(s > 0 && s < n && n < 8000);\n\n    int mxSum = INT_MIN;\n\n    #pragma omp parallel\n    {\n        std::vector<int> ps(n + 1);\n        #pragma omp for reduction(max:mxSum) schedule(static)\n        for (int i = 0; i <= n - s; ++i) {\n            const int rowStart = i * n;\n            const int rowEnd   = (i + s) * n;\n            const int* top    = &pref[rowStart];\n            const int* bottom = &pref[rowEnd];\n\n            // Prefix sums of column differences for this starting row.\n            int acc = 0;\n            ps[0] = 0;\n            for (int j = 0; j < n; ++j) {\n                acc += bottom[j] - top[j];\n                ps[j + 1] = acc;\n            }\n\n            // Evaluate all SxS windows independently via prefix sums.\n            int curMax = INT_MIN;\n            #pragma omp simd reduction(max:curMax)\n            for (int j = 0; j <= n - s; ++j) {\n                int w = ps[j + s] - ps[j];\n                if (w > curMax) curMax = w;\n            }\n\n            if (curMax > mxSum) mxSum = curMax;\n        }\n    }\n\n    printf(\"%d\\n\", mxSum);\n    return 0;\n}\n",
      "path": "src/solution.cpp"
    }
  ],
  "hypothesis": "Replacing the sequential sliding-window inner loop with a per-row prefix-sum array of column differences allows each candidate SxS sum to be evaluated independently, enabling OpenMP SIMD vectorization of the max-reduction over columns. This reduces the critical path of the second worksharing loop while retaining static scheduling and a single combined parallel region, improving runtime on 4 cores.",
  "notes": "Kept FastScanner and prefix construction unchanged; only modified the parallel computation section to use an explicit omp parallel region with per-thread prefix-sum buffers and SIMD reduction. The outer max reduction remains via OpenMP reduction(max).",
